OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly dry with
OL,6,Fbright or sunny spells and just the
OL,7,Fodd shower. Best of the warm sunny
OL,8,Fspells across Down and Antrim but
OL,9,Ffeeling rather cool along the North
OL,10,FCoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and bright start to the
OL,13,Fevening but thicker cloud and
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain will spread
OL,15,Feastwards. A cloudy night with
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain continuing.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA cloudy day with occasional
OL,19,Frain. Best of any dry and bright
OL,20,Fspells most likely towards the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
