OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FFurther rain spreading east on Monday
OL,7,Fthen bright spells and scattered
OL,8,Fshowers on Tuesday. Showers turning
OL,9,Fheavy and thundery on Wednesday.
